      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100151/1802001001510010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ないけど、どうしてそんなことを聞くんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001510020,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "自分で言うのもなんだけど\r\n私って、ひねくれてて面倒くさいとこあるでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100151/1802001001510020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001510030,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "仕事先では抑えて場の空気を守ってるけど\r\nプロデューサーには素で接してる分、しんどいかなって",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100151/1802001001510030"
  },
  {
    "select": "素を見せて\r\nくれるのは嬉しいよ",
    "nextLabel": "1802001001511"
  },
  {
    "select": "しんどいと\r\n思ったことはない",
    "nextLabel": "1802001001512"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "慣れてるから\r\n大丈夫だよ",
    "nextLabel": "1802001001513"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001510040,
    "label": "1802001001511",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "ひねくれた言動を見せられて\r\n喜ぶなんて、変わってるわね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100151/1802001001510040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001510050,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "でも、嫌じゃないならよかった\r\nこれからも今までどおりに接するから、よろしくね？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100151/1802001001510050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001510060,
    "label": "1802001001512",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "本当に？　変に我慢したりしないでね\r\n急にもう無理、とか言われても困るんだから",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100151/1802001001510060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001510070,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "あなたも嫌なことやだめなときはちゃんと言って\r\nそのほうが、私も安心するから",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100151/1802001001510070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001510080,
    "label": "1802001001513",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "慣れてる、ね……たしかに、ここの事務所って\r\n私以外にも癖の強い子が多そうだしね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100151/1802001001510080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001510090,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "私が面倒くさいってことは否定しないんだ\r\nまあ別に、自分でもわかってるからいいんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
